 ## Rental service
 
 `createRentalService()` from `src/index.ts` creates an in-memory service. Add boards or sails with
-`addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice })`, where `dailyPrice` is an integer number of euro cents.
+`addEquipment({ id, kind, dailyPrice, hourlyPrice? })`, where prices are integer numbers of euro cents.
+Rentals shorter than a day can start and end on a UTC hour and cost `hourlyPrice` per hour; equipment
+without an hourly price cannot be rented for a partial day. Rentals lasting a day or longer must still
+start and end at UTC midnight and use `dailyPrice`.
 Use `quote({ itemId, start, end })` to price a rental, `book(...)` to reserve it, and
 `availability({ start, end, kind? })` to list sorted equipment IDs free for the entire period. When
 `kind` is supplied, only that equipment category is included; otherwise all categories are considered.
