+---
+id: task-004-hourly-equipment-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Hourly equipment rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add optional `hourlyPrice` (integer euro cents) to equipment registration. Support rental periods shorter than one day when both UTC endpoints are on the hour, pricing each hour at `hourlyPrice`. Equipment without an hourly price must reject such rentals. Preserve existing daily rental pricing and discount behavior, and document the new feature.
